{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07535","headline":"杂诗六首 三 · 李华","name":"杂诗六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甘酸不私人，元和运五行。\n生人受其用，味正心亦平。\n爪牙相践伤，日与性命争。\n圣人不能绝，钻燧与炮烹。\n嗜慾乘此炽，百金资一倾。\n正销神耗衰，邪胜体充盈。\n颜子有余乐，瓢中寒水清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}